        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Powers Middleton, Josh Brolin\n- Films: a 2013 film, Deadpool 2\n- Roles: executive producer, Cable\n- Franchises: Marvel Comics, X-Men universe\n\nFacts:\n- In 2013, John Powers Middleton had his first executive producer credit on a film.\n- The star of that 2013 film was Josh Brolin.\n- Josh Brolin was later cast as Cable, a Marvel Comics character, in the X-Men universe.\n- Josh Brolin played Cable in the film Deadpool 2.",
